doctype html
html(lang="en")
  head
    meta(charset="UTF-8")
    meta(name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0")
    title Failure to complete action

  body
      p The deadline for "#{actionName}" has passed and you have not completed it.

      p Remember that we plan each action around the number of members we expect to participate.

      p If you miss any assigned non-optional task again next week, your agreement will be suspended automatically.
